{"version":1,"content":"<p>一項最新研究顯示，廣泛存在於日常生活中的部分工業化學物質可能對人體乳腺組織產生意想不到的影響。研究人員利用先進的人體乳腺組織模型發現，即使在較低暴露水平下，一些常見化學物質也能夠誘發與乳腺疾病發展相關的生物學變化，這一結果引發了科研人員對現有化學品安全評估體系的進一步關注。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1583606.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T16:24:54.656961+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T16:15:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T16:18:30.670116+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T16:18:30.670116+00:00","content_hash":"b10e8b6b43c921816fbfb499dd30c35cc6632d3b1a80d987015044603cf52030","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}